{"availability":"available","full":"Mustofa-statcn/surveyscholar","name":"surveyscholar","description":"SurveyScholar is a lightweight, offline-first Progressive Web App (PWA) designed for field research data collection. It stores survey entries securely in browser storage (IndexedDB) and automatically syncs responses with a Google Sheets backend once an internet connection is established.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-17T17:21:46Z","updated":"2026-09-17T18:10:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mustofa-statcn.github.io/surveyscholar/","topics":["data-collection","indexeddb","offline-first-webapp","pwa","research","survey","webapp"],"demo":"https://mustofa-statcn.github.io/surveyscholar/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:46.926Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:46.926Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:46.926Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:14.292Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:33:46.926Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["offline-first field survey collection that fits in one HTML file","live demo · user guide · deploy it · architecture","[](../../actions/workflows/deploy.yml) [](../../actions/workflows/test.yml) [](LICENSE) [](#why-one-file)"],"features":["works with the radio off — entry, editing, validation and export never touch the network","installs like an app — PWA with a service worker; add to home screen, launches full-screen","sequential entry IDs — YY + 5 digits, unique per year, generated inside a single IndexedDB transaction so concurrent saves can't collide","skip logic and sections — conditional questions that can only point backwards, which makes cycles structurally impossible","form versioning — old responses stay readable under the exact question list they were collected with"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mustofa-statcn/surveyscholar/blob/main/README.md","fi